  "page": "page-04",
  "idea": "AppFlowy: the open-source Notion replacement that stays local",
  "text": "Top engineers and productivity nerds are ditching Notion for this local app. Technical builders hate having their wikis, code snippets, and architecture diagrams hosted on third-party servers. Cloud workspaces expose sensitive technical notes to external data breaches and vendor tracking without consent. AppFlowy delivers an extensible open-source environment with offline markdown editing, custom plugins, and local encryption. You secure proprietary technical knowledge while accelerating note retrieval.",
